  "body": "Calling all renovators, flippers, and visionaries — this is your opportunity to unlock the potential of a property in a sought-after Browns Bay location.\r\n\r\nSet in the Rangitoto College zone and offering sea views from the first floor, this property requires significant renovation work to bring it back to life. Whether you’re a builder, handyman, or savvy investor looking for your next project, the possibilities here are undeniable.\r\n\r\n• Sea views from the first floor\r\n• Located in the popular Rangi zone\r\n• Huge potential to add value\r\n• Motivated vendor ready to sell\r\n• Ideal project for renovators and builders\r\n\r\nRoll up your sleeves and turn this rough diamond into something special!",
